#box(image("07-hypothesis-testing_files/figure-typst/fig-clt-1.svg", alt: "Two histograms. For samples of 5, the averages are widely spread and skewed to the right. For samples of 30, they are narrow and nearly symmetrical, centred on the same value."))
], caption: figure.caption(
position: bottom, 
[
The sampling distribution of average caffeine intake, for samples of 5 and of 30 students drawn from the student wellbeing data.
