The function #NormalTok("dist()"); calculates the distances between all pairs of students, and #NormalTok("cutree()"); cuts the tree into groups. A cross-table shows how far the two methods agree:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("hier_clusters ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("cutree");#NormalTok("(tree, ");#AttributeTok("k =");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("4");#NormalTok(")");],
