[#NormalTok("  ");#FunctionTok("labs");#NormalTok("(");#AttributeTok("x =");#NormalTok(" ");#StringTok("\"Days of sleep restriction\"");#NormalTok(", ");#AttributeTok("y =");#NormalTok(" ");#StringTok("\"Reaction time (ms)\"");#NormalTok(") ");#SpecialCharTok("+");],
[#NormalTok("  ");#FunctionTok("theme_minimal");#NormalTok("(");#AttributeTok("base_size =");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("10");#NormalTok(")");],));
#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'");],));
]
#figure([
#box(image("10-mixed-models_files/figure-typst/fig-sleepstudy-1.svg", alt: "Eighteen small scatter plots, one per person. In almost every panel, reaction time rises over the days, but people start at different levels and rise at different rates."))
