- Decompose a series into trend, seasonal, and remainder components with STL.
- Produce benchmark forecasts, and forecasts from exponential smoothing (ETS) and ARIMA models, with fable.
- Evaluate forecasts on a test period, and report forecasts with prediction intervals.

