= Appendix A: Installation and Setup
<sec-app-installation>
This appendix explains how to install everything the book uses, and how to fix the problems that most often get in the way. If you only want to start, the short version is: install #strong[R], then #strong[RStudio], then run the package installation command in #ref(<sec-install-packages>, supplement: [Section]). If you are not ready to install anything yet, every chapter's exercises also run in your web browser, in the #link("../playground/index.html")[playground].

Installers and websites change their appearance from year to year, so this appendix describes each step in words rather than with screenshots. The choices that matter are the same in every version.

